; Pattern player: plays a list of (level, duration) segments from the TX FIFO.
;
; Each 32-bit word is one segment, fed continuously by DMA
; (see pattern_output.cpp):
;   bit 0      pin level
;   bits 31..1 loop count
; The OSR shifts right with autopull at 32 bits, so the level comes out first.
;
; Timing per segment: `out pins` (1) + `out x` (1) + `jmp x--` executed
; count+1 times = count + 3 cycles. The pin changes on the first instruction
; of each segment. As long as DMA keeps the FIFO from running empty, autopull
; never stalls and segments are cycle exact.

.program pattern

.wrap_target
    out pins, 1         ; set the pin level for this segment
    out x, 31           ; load the duration
delay:
    jmp x-- delay
.wrap
